  "_comment": "What the RunPod network volume adds to the official ComfyUI template (runpod/seed.py): ComfyUI moved to `comfyui.ref` (\"latest\" = newest release tag), our custom nodes, and `files` (paths relative to `comfyui_dir`, Comfy Cloud file names so graphs run unmapped). `url` files are downloaded (Civitai ones from Hugging Face mirrors, sha256-matched via civarchive.com); `page` = the Civitai page, and a file with only a page is downloaded by hand into a --from folder. H3 only (no LTX/Sulphur). Add your own i2v LoRAs or a finetuned UNet (config.RUNPOD_H3_UNET) in a copy at data/library/runpod_models.json; seed.py runs with that file as /seed/models.json.",
